 "summary": "New material is genuinely new and reuses located upstream API: covarianceMatrix strictly generalises TauCeti.covMatrix with both bridges supplied, extend_zero_dotProduct is the left-factor mirror of TauCeti's lemma (not derivable over a non-commutative semiring), and variance_eq_zero_iff is built from Mathlib's evariance iff. The dataset layer rests on Mathlib's toBilin'/toQuadraticForm'/polar_toQuadraticMap, PosSemidef.dotProduct_mulVec_*, posSemidef_is_closed and covariance_fun_sum_fun_sum rather than re-deriving them.",
